WEBVTT

00:01.290 --> 00:02.750
Always keep a good poker face.

00:02.920 --> 00:04.670
Taking his father's teaching to heart...

00:04.670 --> 00:06.500
The miraculous magician glides amidst the skyscrapers.

00:06.880 --> 00:08.300
In comes Kaitou Kid!

00:08.800 --> 00:11.720
Today's target is the Angel's Crown.

00:11.720 --> 00:14.220
Now, let the show begin!

01:41.930 --> 01:49.480
Detective Conan is brought to you by these sponsors.

01:55.820 --> 01:56.320
Yo!

01:56.860 --> 01:58.530
I'm Kuroba Kaito.

01:58.530 --> 02:00.370
This may sound like bragging, but...

02:00.370 --> 02:02.660
I'm a pretty awesome magician!

02:06.790 --> 02:10.090
This chick is my childhood friend, Nakamori Aoko.

02:10.090 --> 02:12.550
She's already an 11th grader but still acts like a child!

02:16.380 --> 02:19.220
Aoko's old man is a devilish inspector from the Police HQ.

02:19.640 --> 02:21.510
It seems these days he's all fired up...

02:21.510 --> 02:25.640
Trying to capture Kaitou Kid, a magic trick-employing
thief that's been causing a public uproar.

02:27.850 --> 02:30.900
Don't think you're so great, Kaito,
you still can't beat Kaitou Kid!

02:32.190 --> 02:33.990
What a joke.

02:33.990 --> 02:38.660
The only magician I can't beat is Kuroba
Touichi, who happens to be my dad.

02:45.710 --> 02:48.120
What was behind the wall turned out to be a hidden room.

02:48.250 --> 02:51.630
And for some reason, Kaitou Kid's
costume had been tucked away inside.

02:54.420 --> 02:57.510
Although Kid had fallen off the radar
all of a sudden eight years ago...

02:57.510 --> 02:59.970
He recently resumed activity.

02:59.970 --> 03:02.390
My dad, who was a world renowned magician...

03:02.390 --> 03:05.560
Had also lost his life during a magic
show accident eight years ago.

03:11.060 --> 03:13.730
In order to pursue the truth of the
mystery probably left by my dad...

03:14.150 --> 03:16.530
I proceeded to the place where Kid announced his crime.

03:19.490 --> 03:21.160
But the true identity of the "Kid" that I met there...

03:21.530 --> 03:26.200
Was a former servant of my dad—Jii-chan—or Jii Kounosuke.

03:21.530 --> 03:26.200
Gramps

03:29.120 --> 03:35.000
I learned from Jii-chan that my dad, Kuroba Touichi,
was indeed the Kaitou Kid from eight years ago...

03:35.000 --> 03:38.840
And was murdered by someone
under the guise of an accident.

03:41.180 --> 03:43.680
In order to find the party responsible for my dad's death...

03:43.680 --> 03:47.430
I, Kuroba Kaito, had become Kaitou Kid II!

03:53.690 --> 03:58.690
KAITOU KID'S BUSY DATE

04:19.630 --> 04:23.680
Please give me a break, Young Master Kaito!

04:24.470 --> 04:29.350
I have not heard any details from Master Touichi myself either!

04:29.600 --> 04:34.860
That's why I've been telling you to spit out
everything you know, haven't I, Jii-chan?

04:35.480 --> 04:37.480
Why did my dad...

04:37.480 --> 04:42.070
Kuroba Touichi, assume the form of
Kaitou Kid and start stealing treasures?

04:42.530 --> 04:45.280
And, why did he die?

04:47.280 --> 04:48.790
That's...

04:57.800 --> 04:58.920
Could it be...

04:58.920 --> 05:01.220
Mom made him keep it a secret?

05:02.550 --> 05:06.260
I bet you're going to be busy these days.

05:10.520 --> 05:13.480
OK, don't say anything if you don't wanna!

05:13.480 --> 05:16.810
I have no idea what secret is being
kept between you and Mom, but...

05:16.810 --> 05:20.400
I shall become Kid and raise a storm in order to unearth that!

05:25.990 --> 05:27.700
It's showtime!

05:35.580 --> 05:39.500
Tonight at 0:00, I shall arrive and claim the Angel's Crown!
— Kaitou Kid ♥

05:40.420 --> 05:45.430
Medieval Treasure Exhibition

05:57.150 --> 05:58.770
Get!

06:03.690 --> 06:05.910
No need to worry, Madam.

06:06.610 --> 06:10.450
Yours faithful, Jii Kounosuke, swears on his life...

06:10.450 --> 06:15.330
That he shall support Young Master
Kaito no matter what it may take.

06:21.550 --> 06:22.880
Wait up, Kid!

06:23.340 --> 06:25.090
I shall arrest you tonight!

06:28.800 --> 06:29.640
He vanished!

06:29.640 --> 06:30.100
Where is he?

06:30.640 --> 06:31.430
Don't panic!

06:31.430 --> 06:32.350
It's his usual M.O.!

06:32.930 --> 06:33.640
Up there?

06:35.520 --> 06:37.770
You fell for it, Kid!

06:44.820 --> 06:45.780
What?

06:49.780 --> 06:50.870
Do you see?

06:50.870 --> 06:54.620
Nakamori Ginzou's ultimate strategy to capture Kid!

06:54.750 --> 06:55.700
I beg to differ...

06:55.960 --> 06:57.210
About the "ultimate" part!

06:59.790 --> 07:00.710
What the...

07:05.970 --> 07:06.920
Oh no!

07:23.400 --> 07:24.820
TONIGHT I SHALL TEMPORARILY RETREAT.
BUT, THIS COMING SUNDAY AT 18:00,
I SHALL AGAIN ARRIVE AND CLAIM
THE ANGEL'S CROWN!
KAITOU KID ♥

07:24.820 --> 07:27.700
TONIGHT I SHALL TEMPORARILY RETREAT.
BUT, THIS COMING SUNDAY AT 18:00,
I SHALL AGAIN ARRIVE AND CLAIM
THE ANGEL'S CROWN!

07:28.860 --> 07:30.070
Damn!

07:30.070 --> 07:31.240
Playing around with me...

07:31.990 --> 07:34.030
But that face of his was indeed...

07:36.450 --> 07:38.040
No doubt about it!

07:39.120 --> 07:41.000
WHAAAAA—!?

07:41.960 --> 07:42.960
What?

07:42.960 --> 07:44.300
You want me to say it again?

07:45.300 --> 07:45.800
No...

07:47.090 --> 07:48.670
Go on a date with me!

07:48.970 --> 07:51.010
What's that, some kind of new joke?

07:52.050 --> 07:53.550
Don't scare me like that...

07:53.550 --> 07:55.180
Are you going, or not?

07:56.100 --> 07:58.560
Who's gonna go with a shorty like you?

07:59.810 --> 08:01.190
I know...

08:01.850 --> 08:03.610
I know that too, but...

08:04.570 --> 08:05.230
But...

08:06.480 --> 08:07.230
Please...

08:12.360 --> 08:13.070
Fine...

08:13.950 --> 08:14.910
Really!?

08:16.490 --> 08:19.410
Then, Tropical Land this Sunday!

08:19.410 --> 08:20.080
It's a promise!

08:21.210 --> 08:22.330
Wait!

08:23.040 --> 08:25.630
But Sunday is my announced date!

08:27.000 --> 08:30.050
So Aoko, you like Kaito-kun?

08:30.050 --> 08:31.220
Who likes that kinda guy!?

08:31.220 --> 08:33.470
But you asked him out on a date...

08:33.470 --> 08:34.970
It's because...

08:34.970 --> 08:35.930
My dad...

08:36.810 --> 08:37.930
Right.

08:37.930 --> 08:39.600
It's all Dad's fault.

08:41.020 --> 08:41.810
Aoko...

08:43.480 --> 08:45.480
Kaitou Kid is Kaito-kun!

08:49.030 --> 08:50.820
What sorta fantasy are you talking about, Dad?

08:51.150 --> 08:53.200
No, there's no doubt.

08:53.200 --> 08:54.990
I saw his face.

08:55.410 --> 08:59.080
Plus, Kaito-kun does magic too, does he not?

08:59.080 --> 09:00.450
All the more suspicious.

09:01.040 --> 09:02.210
Dad...

09:02.410 --> 09:05.080
Kid announced this Sunday as the date of his crime.

09:05.080 --> 09:08.090
Well, everything will become clear when it arrives.

09:09.590 --> 09:12.130
SHUDDAAAAAAP!

09:12.510 --> 09:14.930
There's no way Kaito is Kaitou Kid, now is there!?

09:15.510 --> 09:19.180
Because Kaito already promised that he'd
go on a date with Aoko this Sunday!

09:20.810 --> 09:23.020
Kaito would never do...

09:23.020 --> 09:24.940
Something like that, would he?

09:25.940 --> 09:27.400
It's Kaito-kun again, no!?

09:27.400 --> 09:29.230
Peeping into the changing room!

09:29.230 --> 09:30.070
Geez!

09:31.030 --> 09:33.400
Your fault for using such a teeny lock like this!

09:33.400 --> 09:34.860
Wait up!

09:38.080 --> 09:39.370
Suspicious...

09:52.970 --> 09:55.300
Kaito's late...

09:55.930 --> 09:58.470
Geez, what's that girl thinking?

09:58.800 --> 10:02.180
Don't tell me she knows about the date on my manifesto...

10:02.180 --> 10:04.940
Could it be that that inspector found out my true identity?

10:05.230 --> 10:06.850
It can't be...

10:08.810 --> 10:09.730
Yo!

10:10.190 --> 10:12.030
I've kept you waiting.

10:12.400 --> 10:13.360
Kaito...

10:16.070 --> 10:17.610
I believed...

10:17.610 --> 10:18.780
That you'd come for me.

10:18.780 --> 10:20.950
Didn't I promise?

10:20.950 --> 10:21.830
Idiot...

10:22.870 --> 10:23.410
Let's go!

10:29.670 --> 10:30.540
Look, look!

10:30.920 --> 10:33.010
That elephant's amazing!

10:33.010 --> 10:33.800
Right?

10:34.510 --> 10:35.800
It's a robot.

10:35.800 --> 10:37.970
That so?

10:37.970 --> 10:40.390
HAUNTED HOUSE

10:38.300 --> 10:39.180
Let's go in!

10:43.520 --> 10:44.810
The picture's moving!?

10:51.610 --> 10:54.030
It's only this room that's descending!

10:54.030 --> 10:55.240
That so?

10:55.360 --> 10:56.450
Let's play!

10:56.450 --> 10:57.400
Awesome!

11:02.330 --> 11:03.080
How cute!

11:05.250 --> 11:07.040
Wow, your sweat stinks!

11:08.620 --> 11:09.960
Kaito...

11:12.090 --> 11:12.790
Kaito...

11:13.880 --> 11:14.800
Wait up...

11:17.220 --> 11:18.260
I said...

11:18.590 --> 11:20.260
Wait up!

11:21.260 --> 11:23.890
Why do you have to play pranks like that!?

11:23.890 --> 11:25.810
Look at me, Kaito!

11:27.940 --> 11:28.890
Good!

11:30.310 --> 11:31.810
That's more like you, Aoko!

11:31.810 --> 11:32.940
Now that's natural.

11:37.360 --> 11:38.490
What the?

11:38.490 --> 11:40.490
All you did was make fun of people!

11:40.740 --> 11:41.870
You...

11:43.530 --> 11:45.240
Freeze, Bimboko!

11:45.240 --> 11:46.410
Who's Bimboko?

11:46.410 --> 11:47.370
You Jerkaito!

11:47.370 --> 11:48.660
Don't call me Jerkaito!

11:56.840 --> 11:59.680
SEASIDE RESTAURANT

11:58.670 --> 11:59.680
You idiot!

11:59.930 --> 12:02.590
Why do you have to eat fish in front of my eyes!?

12:02.590 --> 12:05.140
But I love it!

12:09.100 --> 12:10.310
How dare you!

12:10.310 --> 12:11.520
Take this!

12:11.520 --> 12:12.980
Returning the favor!

12:18.070 --> 12:18.860
Look at that!

12:33.330 --> 12:36.090
It's about the time stated in my manifesto...

12:40.550 --> 12:42.340
I want to watch it soon!

12:42.340 --> 12:43.590
A movie, huh?

12:43.760 --> 12:45.510
Perfect opportunity to slip out.

12:49.220 --> 12:51.520
Air time is forty minutes...

12:51.520 --> 12:53.520
If I don't manage to return before then...

12:55.610 --> 12:56.440
I...

12:56.440 --> 12:59.280
Can't deal with 3-D, so I'll be waiting outside!

12:59.280 --> 13:00.900
Oh, wait.

13:04.360 --> 13:06.580
What... is this?

13:06.580 --> 13:08.740
Sorry, but just for a while...

13:09.490 --> 13:12.330
Stay still... just for a while.

13:12.330 --> 13:15.830
Now everyone, put on your 3-D glasses!

13:12.960 --> 13:13.540
Aoko...

13:14.040 --> 13:15.790
Well, let's watch it!

13:17.170 --> 13:19.920
Does she know my true identity?

13:19.920 --> 13:23.380
So that inspector did see my face last time after all...

13:23.800 --> 13:25.720
This is so exciting!

13:25.930 --> 13:30.220
We will now begin showing the Kamen Yaiba 3-D movie!

13:25.930 --> 13:30.220
Masked Yaiber

13:40.070 --> 13:41.860
Hurry up, Young Master!

13:44.570 --> 13:47.240
I need to finish things up before the movie ends...

13:47.240 --> 13:48.870
And return to Aoko—!

13:50.040 --> 13:53.120
Can't you drive more safely, Jii-chan?

13:53.120 --> 13:56.380
If I were to drive responsibly, we would never make it!

13:56.380 --> 13:58.790
That's true, but...

14:17.940 --> 14:19.400
Only five more minutes on the clock!

14:20.070 --> 14:21.690
Prepare yourselves for the worst!

14:21.690 --> 14:22.150
Roger!

14:25.530 --> 14:27.660
Kamen Yaiba 3-D!

14:25.530 --> 14:27.660
Masked Yaiber

14:31.540 --> 14:32.580
One minute remaining!

14:33.370 --> 14:35.870
Hey, do you know where the inspector went?

14:36.250 --> 14:37.540
No idea...

14:58.150 --> 14:58.810
Gotta hurry...

14:59.060 --> 15:01.230
Only 18 minutes till the movie is over!

15:13.410 --> 15:14.080
Inspector!?

15:14.330 --> 15:16.200
You fell for it, Kid!

15:17.250 --> 15:19.500
You fell for it, Kamen Yaiba!

15:20.210 --> 15:22.920
I shall reveal your true identity right here, right now!

15:25.090 --> 15:28.220
I shall reveal your true identity right here, right now!

15:33.890 --> 15:35.270
WHAT!?

15:41.190 --> 15:43.320
My true identity is you!

15:43.320 --> 15:45.110
You are in fact my clone!

15:50.740 --> 15:52.280
I'm a master of disguise!

15:52.660 --> 15:55.080
I can assume the form of anyone I choose!

16:02.670 --> 16:04.290
There is only one truth!

16:05.550 --> 16:06.920
IDIOTS!

16:07.300 --> 16:08.970
DON'T CLAP!

16:13.300 --> 16:14.810
Aoko...

16:15.220 --> 16:17.720
Right, Inspector Nakamori.

16:17.720 --> 16:20.980
I've studied people around you like the back of my hand!

16:21.310 --> 16:24.690
So that Kaito-kun's face the other day was also your doing!?

16:24.690 --> 16:26.570
Correct!

16:26.570 --> 16:27.610
Damn!

16:28.150 --> 16:30.070
Bye then, Daddy!

16:31.110 --> 16:32.990
You freak...

16:39.290 --> 16:40.410
Damn...

16:41.160 --> 16:41.960
Don't flinch!

16:41.960 --> 16:43.120
Give chase!

16:43.120 --> 16:45.210
Kid...

16:50.220 --> 16:53.590
Damn, what a significant time loss...

16:54.300 --> 16:56.220
Only five minutes before the movie ends!

16:56.470 --> 16:58.520
If I can't make it back then, Aoko will...

16:59.020 --> 17:00.430
Find out my true identity!

17:00.980 --> 17:02.100
Step on it, Jii-chan!

17:02.100 --> 17:02.850
Leave it to me!

17:16.780 --> 17:18.030
No way!

17:18.410 --> 17:20.330
My maintenance should have been flawless...

17:20.330 --> 17:22.580
It's because of all your reckless driving!

17:23.120 --> 17:25.080
Oh, right, what about my hang glider?

17:25.080 --> 17:27.250
It's still being repaired!

17:27.250 --> 17:30.460
Since you broke it with your rough handling, Young Master!

17:30.460 --> 17:32.130
<i>Excuse</i> me!

17:32.130 --> 17:33.430
Only four minutes!

17:33.430 --> 17:34.380
Damn...

17:34.380 --> 17:35.510
I gotta run!

17:36.390 --> 17:37.930
Young Master!

17:44.190 --> 17:45.600
RUN!

17:45.600 --> 17:47.560
Run, run!

17:48.690 --> 17:50.400
Only one minute!

17:54.110 --> 17:56.570
There's still 2km from here to the 3-D theater!

17:56.570 --> 17:58.240
Am I doomed!?

18:01.580 --> 18:02.950
You're doomed...

18:03.410 --> 18:05.710
Kamen Yaiba!

18:07.580 --> 18:08.790
No use...

18:10.880 --> 18:12.210
I can't make it...

18:18.800 --> 18:20.970
This...

18:21.140 --> 18:22.060
Nice!

18:22.470 --> 18:23.980
The fight is...

18:23.980 --> 18:25.190
Still on!

18:25.190 --> 18:28.060
Feast your eyes on my real strength!

18:29.730 --> 18:30.980
That's the spirit!

18:30.980 --> 18:32.940
GOOOOO!

18:41.990 --> 18:43.330
Thirty seconds left...

18:43.330 --> 18:44.330
Can I make it?

18:51.710 --> 18:53.380
Wait...

19:11.440 --> 19:12.820
Only 20 seconds!

19:14.280 --> 19:16.650
GOOOOO!

19:23.990 --> 19:25.500
Beat him!

19:25.500 --> 19:26.830
Beat him up!

19:49.020 --> 19:50.310
Just kidding.

19:50.310 --> 19:50.900
Let's go!

20:01.700 --> 20:03.660
Yaiba Kick!

20:10.330 --> 20:16.670
END

20:13.960 --> 20:16.670
Everyone, throwing things is not permitted!

20:18.550 --> 20:20.550
It was so thrilling, Kaito!

20:21.550 --> 20:22.510
Yeah!

20:22.930 --> 20:24.510
Awesome for sure!

20:32.650 --> 20:35.230
However, I'm completely wiped...

20:35.980 --> 20:36.780
Dad!

20:37.820 --> 20:39.900
You're watching, right, Kaitou Kid!?

20:40.280 --> 20:42.910
I will definitely arrest you next time, you bastard!

20:43.200 --> 20:44.950
What the, it's just TV...

20:43.450 --> 20:45.280
This was from Inspector Nakamori...

20:44.950 --> 20:46.410
I'm so glad...

20:45.280 --> 20:48.120
Who admirably protected the Angel's
Crown from Kaitou Kid's vile clutches.

20:46.410 --> 20:48.620
That Kaito is indeed Kaito.

20:49.790 --> 20:50.790
Wait for me a bit.

20:52.580 --> 20:56.710
So Aoko really did this in an attempt to clear my name...

20:58.210 --> 21:00.090
Such unnecessarily wasted effort!

21:07.850 --> 21:08.430
Here!

21:09.560 --> 21:11.430
Your favorite ice cream, Kaito.

21:11.940 --> 21:12.810
Tsk!

21:12.810 --> 21:14.560
Don't do things out of character for you!

21:15.810 --> 21:17.440
Even if it's unlike me...

21:17.440 --> 21:18.570
I'm still Aoko.

21:20.110 --> 21:21.820
Geez, you're so cold.

21:23.700 --> 21:25.070
Like this ice cream.

21:27.580 --> 21:28.370
But...

21:29.950 --> 21:31.410
Ice cream...

21:35.040 --> 21:36.460
Is sweet.

21:36.710 --> 21:37.880
Kaito...

22:06.320 --> 22:09.490
It looks like a "happy engine" for them after all!

23:44.630 --> 23:56.020
NEXT EPISODE

23:45.260 --> 23:46.090
Next time...

23:46.090 --> 23:50.840
We have a cute princess coming all the way
from the Duchy of Sabrina in Europe to visit!

23:50.840 --> 23:53.220
But, it looks like a hot-aired detective is following her...

23:53.220 --> 23:55.350
Along with the announcement that he'd arrest Kaitou Kid!

23:56.020 --> 23:59.600
THE PRINCESS PREFERS MAGIC

24:00.520 --> 24:08.240
Detective Conan was brought to you by these sponsors.

24:14.780 --> 24:19.580
Cat

24:15.410 --> 24:17.250
Next Kid's Magic

24:19.580 --> 24:24.590
LOOK FORWARD TO THE NEXT EPISODE

24:19.660 --> 24:21.170
I'm the star next
week too!

24:21.170 --> 24:23.000
I'm so glad that
guy's not Kid!
